---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Success Stories | Zeta"
  description="Discover inspiring stories of professional growth, mentorship, leadership development, and meaningful contributions within the Zeta Leadership Community."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Success Stories</p>

      <h1>Professional Journeys That Inspire Growth</h1>

      <p>
        Every journey is unique. These stories highlight the experiences of
        individuals who have grown through mentorship, professional
        development, leadership opportunities, and meaningful service within
        the Zeta Leadership Community. Each story is shared with the
        contributor's approval and reflects their personal experience. Individual
        results and career paths will vary.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story Framework -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell content-grid">

      <article>

        <h2>Where the Journey Began</h2>

        <p>
          Learn about each individual's background, previous professional
          experience, and the aspirations or challenges that led them to
          explore opportunities within Zeta.
        </p>

      </article>

      <article>

        <h2>Growth Through Mentorship</h2>

        <p>
          Discover how structured learning, mentorship, practical
          experience, and leadership development contributed to their
          professional growth and personal development.
        </p>

      </article>

      <article>

        <h2>Meaningful Progress</h2>

        <p>
          Read verified milestones and achievements approved for publication,
          reflecting each contributor's unique journey while recognizing that
          every individual's experience and outcomes are different.
        </p>

      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing -->
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <h2>Every Journey Is Different</h2>

      <p>
        At Zeta, we celebrate progress, continuous learning, and leadership
        development rather than comparing results. Our community is built on
        mentorship, collaboration, and helping individuals reach their own
        potential while creating opportunities for others to grow.
      </p>

      <p class="verification-note">
        Stories published on this page are based on real experiences and are
        shared with the contributor's consent. They are intended to provide
        insight into individual professional journeys and should not be
        interpreted as a guarantee of future results or career outcomes.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
